From 1758eae33a9a91e3974d8d12271c1f4aef4362e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:16:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/52] Modern abilities, batch 2: 20 triggered and switch-in
 abilities

- New battle script command callnative, a move-end state for attacker-side
  ability effects, and a shared 'ability raised/lowered its stat' script
- Moxie, Defiant, Competitive (incl. after Intimidate), Justified, Rattled,
  Steadfast, Weak Armor, Anger Point, Sap Sipper, Storm Drain, Wind Rider,
  Cursed Body, Poison Touch, Aftermath, Regenerator, Download, Frisk,
  Unnerve (blocks foes' berries), Moody, Healer
- Species re-assigned so these modern abilities are now in use

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
